00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:59.490
then it totally might make you happier. But you have to realize what's actually making you happy. It's not necessarily the house. It's what you're using that house to do and to become is what's actually making you happy. All right, last question comes from Juan. He says, what are the things a person can do to be better at communication? How do I get the stories I tell to be better? This is what I've tried to do my entire career. And so maybe it's too specific to what I do, which is kind of financial behavioral writing.

